invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_vector.c
catches: mlkem_vector_equiv_test
reason: the forward transform stores its first eight coefficients of
  each block without the Barrett reduction mlk_poly_ntt ends with, so
  they leave unreduced, where the encoder that follows expects them
  centered. The equivalence test finds the coefficients that differ.

--- old
    lanes_store(p, lanes_barrett_reduce(a));
--- new
    lanes_store(p, a);
